WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:04.004
This is what tomorrow looks like.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.881
Let there be lights

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:08.217
and wide open spaces.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.386
This isn't the place
for people to punch in and out.

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:16.058
WeWork's role is to elevate
the world's consciousness.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.145
WeWork isn't just a company.

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:24.525
It's a movement.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.361
We've got to dream.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:29.488
Adam will manifest it.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:31.448
It's magic, and you're magic.

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:33.575
When I say "We," you say "Work!"

00:00:33.659 --> 00:00:34.493
-We!
-Work!

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:37.704
All you have is me.

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.168
You know you're not God, right?

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:44.419
You have to admit...

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:47.422
I do look a little bit like him.

